WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.625
Section 6: Share this investigation.

00:00:03.575 --> 00:00:11.475
Every share puts evidence in front of someone who might act — a journalist, a lawyer, an MP's staffer, a fellow citizen.

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:24.500
The highest-impact pages to share are the Criminal Code Analysis with 42 mapped charges, the MP Scorecard showing every MP's record, and the Evidence Index documenting what they said versus what they did.
